{'name': "McDonald's", 'address': '6900 Marketplace Dr', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Food, Fast Food, Restaurants, Burgers, American (Traditional), Coffee & Tea', 'hours': {'Monday': '5:30-0:0', 'Tuesday': '5:30-0:0', 'Wednesday': '5:30-0:0', 'Thursday': '5:30-0:0', 'Friday': '5:30-0:0', 'Saturday': '5:30-0:0', 'Sunday': '5:30-0:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'romantic': False, 'intimate': False, 'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'divey': False, 'classy': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 2.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-10-10 05:14:30', 'review_text': "My worst experience with fast food.\nDidn't even look like a sandwich.\nWas a pile of shit.\nWhat the fuck is wrong with you people?\n I will NEVER!,,,,,,, go back to this shithole."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-03-23 21:12:37', 'review_text': 'Not good at all dey cold chicken nuggets seemed over cooked, and cold food  never again will order from here'}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-01-30 05:20:50', 'review_text': "The worst Mcdonald's I have ever been too. I ordered a 10 piece spicy nuggets and watched the guy literally touch every persons order with no gloves on. Bare hands on every food. My boyfriend asked the cashier multiple times if she can tell him to put on gloves in which she said she would tell him and never did. After asking again she claimed she told him when I was looking at her the whole time and she never once walked back there. There is no excuse for unsanitary conditions. The FDA needs to get involved with this McDonalds. Especially during a time of Covid. I am highly upset and would love to talk to a manager about these unacceptable conditions."}]}
