ned at a significantly faster speed. In any case, I would surely come back again (when I am not in a rush)."}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2013-06-21 22:57:00', 'review_text': 'This place is hidden down an alley, which seems to keep the crowds out. Very tasty and unique pizzas and a few good beers on tap. Solid place for a reasonable priced meal.'}]}
