e guys are complaining about."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-09-17 02:00:34', 'review_text': 'Worst service ever. The food actually looked really good but the owner was so rude. As we sat down she actually told us "you guys need to order already because we\'re busy" we had been sitting there for no more than 5 min to look at the menu. We decided to walk out and as we walked out she said "I\'m glad you\'re leaving. Don\'t come back again" trust me we won\'t !'}]}
