rs). I enjoyed the seafood burrito (shrimp and salmon) as a bowl. They did a good job of knowing how to accommodate a gluten and dairy free diet. My husband got the burrito Vicentas a d loved it. \n\nWe also got a tropical margarita and a jamaica margarita (hibiscus flavor) which were both fabulous.\n\nThe only negative was the service went downhill throughout the night. It started out great but towards the end if our visit it seemed like we could never find our waiter and it took way longer than it should for him to return to take care of our bill.\n\nBut all in all I definitely reccomend checking out this restaurant!'}]}
