ermined to give it a second try because I love Asian fusion cuisine!\n\nSecond time I ordered the famous crunchy blue crab, shrimp salad and I thought it was SO refreshing and flavorful! It's around $15 so not bad for a large salad. Mine only had about 3 pieces of shrimp and plenty of blue crab to finish the salad. I do recommend the dish but I believe the other items are hit or miss. \n\nFor my people who are COVID conscious, they clean tables and have a sign to let you know it's been sanitized ."}]}
