orld where customer service has deteriorated into nothingness, Ashley Beaty is out there making a difference.  When I arrived on Thursday to pick up my sandwiches, I was met with a great attitude, a well packaged and correct order.  I hope that you properly recognize her for her commitment to your company and to us the customers.\nSincerely,\nPhillip P."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-07-28 00:23:29', 'review_text': "This is probably the worst location I've been too. The service no matter what time of day you go is always horrible! Tried giving them another chance but this is the absolute last time I would come here.. need to hire better employees. And to make it worse the air condition is leaking."}]}
