ily. I can confidently say we will not be back."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-21 04:04:05', 'review_text': "We have enjoyed pascucci's for so many years now and just went tonight. It's always wonderful. I usually get the Bellagio pasta, but tonight got the ravioli sampler, in the mood to try each one. So good. Not sure which one was my favorite, had to keep tasting. We sat outside in a covered patio with a lovely warm heater. The garlic bread is such a treat. Such generous portions, went home with a great lunch for tomorrow. If I don't raid the fridge tonite...."}]}
