{'name': 'Cafe 154', 'address': '4151 Foothill Rd Building A Main Fl, Bldg A', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Cafes, Restaurants, Cafeteria', 'hours': {'Monday': '6:30-18:0', 'Tuesday': '6:30-18:0', 'Wednesday': '6:30-18:0', 'Thursday': '6:30-18:0', 'Friday': '6:30-17:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': None, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': False, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': False, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': False, 'casual': False}}, 'business_stars': 4.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2019-08-22 16:05:29', 'review_text': 'I came here for the Axxess deal: free first regular latte or drop coffee. First of all, way to use the Axxess card, Cafe 154! Many businesses are skimping out, but a full on free item with no purchase requirement is a great hook.\n\nI was planning on only getting the latte, but upon entering the cafe, I was confronted with a small case of high quality pastries. Immediately after I began gazing at the treats, a friendly woman came up and asked me if I had any questions about the pastries. I asked if she had any suggestions, and she smiled and sighed exaggeratedly as if to say what a hard choice it would be because they were all so good. She recommended the berry scone or the croissants. I was eyes a generously almond/powdered sugar encrusted croissant, and ordered that, along with a latte. The same woman asked if I\'d like to add a syrup for the difference in price (deal was for only the regular latte). Normally I normally would decline, but this was "homemade" syrup, so I got the dark chocolate.\n\nBest latte and croissant I\'ve had in Santa Barbara! The chocolate syrup was rich and perfectly sweet; the almond croissant was both heavily crusted and filled with almond paste, and not greasy like many croissants. So delicious!! I ended up paying $5 total\n\nGreat products, great staff, reasonable prices for a high quality cafe.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2018-12-30 18:23:01', 'review_text': 'Great place, food is outstanding and Bulletproof Coffee prepared perfectly.  lovely outdoor seating and super friendly staff.  Someone with high standards is clearly in charge!'}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2018-10-05 19:48:19', 'review_text': 'They serve coffee using Green Star coffee beans! They sell sandwiches, salads, smoothies and coffee drinks at reasonable prices. Got an iced latte for only $2.89 and the espresso is strong and flavorful!'}]}
