ox has a great selection.  Bartender was awesome...got us a great hookup with a cowboy party bus driver so we didn't have to wait for 2 cabs & that guy was awesome!  Pizza delivery next door was ideal & yummy.  Heard the taco truck across street was really good, often with a line before they even open..next time!  Fresh sour mix made daily for margaritas was the BOMB!   Would definitely recommend this place to go especially since its off the beaten path.  Really nice guys were hanging out here and they were fun but respectful of our girls group.  They definitely deserve more cute girls in there..so get in there ladies!  We will be back!"}]}
